p>Correct option:</p>

<p><strong>You can use both read replicas and multi-AZ deployment for disas=
ter recovery</strong></p>

<p>Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS) makes it easy to set up,=
 operate, and scale a relational database in the cloud. Read replicas allow=
 you to create read-only copies that are synchronized with your master data=
base. Read replicas are used for improved read performance. You can also pl=
ace your read replica in a different AWS Region closer to your users for be=
tter performance. Using a cross-Region read replica can also help ensure th=
at you get back up and running if you experience a regional availability is=
sue in case of a disaster. Read replicas are an example of horizontal scali=
ng of resources.</p>

<p>Read replica Overview:
<img src=3D"https://assets-pt.media.datacumulus.com/aws-clf-pt/assets/pt4-q=
8-i1.jpg" style=3D"display: none;"><span class=3D"ud-component--base-compon=
ents--open-full-size-image"><div class=3D"open-full-size-image--wrapper--R4=
