N to create a logically isolated section of the AWS Cloud.</p>

<p><strong>Subnet</strong> - A subnet is a range of IP addresses within you=
r VPC. A subnet is not an AWS service, so this option is ruled out.</p>

<p><strong>Network Access Control List (Network ACL)</strong> - A network a=
ccess control list (network NACL) is an optional layer of security for your=
 VPC that acts as a firewall for controlling traffic in and out of one or m=
ore subnets. A network access control list (network NACL) is not an AWS ser=
vice, so this option is ruled out.</p>

